Verifies [temp.deduct.call]/3 forwarding reference deduction rules:
lvalue -> T=A&, const lvalue -> T=const A&, rvalue -> T=A.  Uses
std::is_same from <type_traits>, hence gcc-only until libc++ support
catches up.
